---
title: Maple Frappuccino
servings: 2
time required: 5 minutes
course: Drink
cuisine: American
---

Blend together @ice{4%cups}, @coffee{1%cup}(alternatively, 4 shots espresso), @maple syrup{½%cup}, @almond extract{2%tsp}, @milk{1%cup}, @nutmeg{dash}, and @vanilla bean ice cream{2%scoops}(can replace with 2 tsp vanilla extract with some more milk) until smooth. Top with @?caramel sauce{}, @?cinnamon sugar{}, and @?whip cream{} as desired.